WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.428
[Dramatic Soaring 80s Synthesizer and Pulsing Bass Intro]

00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:28.500
You're on the sofa burning up, your fever's at 99.8

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:35.500
