00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:57.500
So we put the disc inside the tray, twelve-hour fantasy

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:05.500
We dimmed the lights and pressed the play, a wall of sound, our new decree

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:12.500
Sprawling around you on the floor, a fortress made of friends

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:18.500
This is the night your mother's war officially ends

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:25.000
A Sister's Love is on the screen, a cheesy, epic 80s sound

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.500
We are the fortress, we're the shield, on solid ground

00:01:31.598 --> 00:01:40.000
We'll be the heroes in your plot, the love the tyrant never got

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:51.638
We'll burn her shadow from your mind, the family you were meant to find

